[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>1. Undo the bolt (1a), disconnect the electrical connectors (1b) and remove the switch (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Switch on left front door</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004795\">See I016 SWITCH ON LEFT FRONT DOOR.</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Switch on right front door</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004799\">See I017 SWITCH ON RIGHT FRONT DOOR</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223003157.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the electrical connectors for the switch.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Switch on left front door</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004795\">See I016 SWITCH ON LEFT FRONT DOOR.</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000694.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Switch on right front door</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/223004799\">See I017 SWITCH ON RIGHT FRONT DOOR</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the switch and fix it with the bolt.</p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Check that the switch is working properly by opening the door and checking that the front courtesy light comes on.</p>"]]